ds a third variant 'ability_check' (or a typed sub-variant like 'intelligence_check'). The existing modify_roll_advantage shape requires a RollKind[] for its 'on' field, and ability checks are not covered.","evidence":"Advantage on Intelligence (Investigation) checks made to examine something within that range"}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/magic_item_eyes_of_minute_seeing.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0.001}
