../../results-srd/monk_open_hand_technique_l3/verdict.json:1:{"unit_slug":"monk_open_hand_technique_l3","verdict":"structural_widening","typecheck_exit":-1,"tracer_exit":-1,"harness_atoms":[],"harness_relations":[],"unknown_atoms":[],"unknown_relations":[],"claude_self_verdict":"structural_widening","claude_proposed_widenings":[{"kind":"new_subgraph","name":"ClassFeatureOnHitTriggerMechanics (family: on_hit_trigger)","justification":"Open Hand Technique fires on a hit from a specific action source (Flurry of Blows), not from a free activation. ClassFeatureMechanics has only the 'activation' family, which presupposes an activationCost + use_count resource. This unit needs an on-hit rider family for ClassFeatureRecord, parallel to MasteryMechanics['on_hit_trigger'] but binding to a named action source rather than a weapon-type filter.","evidence":"Whenever you hit a creature with an attack granted by your Flurry of Blows, you can impose one of the following effects on that target."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"MasteryTrigger (or new ClassFeatureTrigger) :: action_source_hit","justification":"The trigger is constrained to 'attacks granted by Flurry of Blows'. Existing MasteryTrigger variants (weapon_hit, weapon_hit_melee_only) filter by weapon kind, not by action source. A new variant carrying an action source identifier (e.g. 'flurry_of_blows') is needed.","evidence":"...an attack granted by your Flurry of Blows..."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"ChooseEffect (player chooses one-of N effects)","justification":"The feature presents a menu of three independent effects and the player picks one per trigger. Neither ClassFeatureEffect nor MasteryEffect has a 'choose_from' composition. The v4 taxonomy lists 'choose' as a procedure atom but there is no surface type that wraps a ReadonlyArray of candidate effects under a player-choice gate.","evidence":"...you can impose one of the following effects on that target. Addle. / Push. / Topple."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"SaveGateRiderResult :: deny_opportunity_attack","justification":"Addle grants an automatic on-hit effect (no save) that denies Opportunity Attacks until turn start. deny_opportunity_attack is a v4 effect atom but is absent from SaveGateRiderResult and ClassFeatureEffect. Additionally, Addle has no save gate at all — it is unconditional on hit — so even extending SaveGateRiderResult is insufficient; a separate 'auto_on_hit' effect slot is needed.","evidence":"Addle. The target can't make Opportunity Attacks until the start of its next turn."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"SaveGateRiderResult :: force_move","justification":"Push force-moves the target up to 15 feet on a failed STR save. force_move is a v4 atom but is absent from SaveGateRiderResult (which only has apply_condition and none) and from ClassFeatureEffect.","evidence":"Push. The target must succeed on a Strength saving throw or be pushed up to 15 feet away from you."}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/monk_open_hand_technique_l3.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}
