ttunementRequirement on MagicItemRecord","justification":"The item requires attunement. The attune procedure atom exists in v4, but the surface type has no field or subtype to record whether a magic item requires attunement and which attunement_slot it binds. MagicItemRecord needs an attunement field.","evidence":"Requires Attunement"}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/magic_item_hat_of_disguise.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}
