../../results-srd/fighter_survivor_l18/verdict.json:1:{"unit_slug":"fighter_survivor_l18","verdict":"structural_widening","typecheck_exit":-1,"tracer_exit":-1,"harness_atoms":[],"harness_relations":[],"unknown_atoms":[],"unknown_relations":[],"claude_self_verdict":"structural_widening","claude_proposed_widenings":[{"kind":"new_subgraph","name":"passive_class_feature family","justification":"ClassFeatureMechanics only has the 'activation' family, which requires activationCost + UseCountResource + resetCadence. Both Defy Death (always-on passive) and Heroic Rally (automatic turn-start trigger, no cost, no use count) cannot be honestly expressed as 'activated' features. A new family is needed for passive/automatic class feature effects.","evidence":"Defy Death: 'You have Advantage on Death Saving Throws.' (no action, no limit). Heroic Rally: 'At the start of each of your turns, you regain Hit Points...' (automatic, conditioned on state, no activation)."},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"DiceAmount — flat_plus_ability_mod variant","justification":"Heroic Rally heals '5 plus your Constitution modifier'. DiceAmount only supports dice-based expressions with static flat bonuses; it has no way to express a dynamic ability modifier addend. A new variant like {kind: 'flat_plus_ability_mod', flat: number, ability: Ability} is required.","evidence":"Heroic Rally: 'you regain Hit Points equal to 5 plus your Constitution modifier'"},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"RollKind — death_saving_throw","justification":"Defy Death grants Advantage specifically on Death Saving Throws, which are mechanically distinct from ordinary saving throws (no ability modifier, automatic outcomes at 1/20, three-failure death). Current RollKind is 'attack_roll' | 'saving_throw' with no death-save distinction.","evidence":"Defy Death: 'You have Advantage on Death Saving Throws.'"},{"kind":"new_variant","name":"conditional trigger predicate (Bloodied + HP > 0)","justification":"Heroic Rally fires only when the character is Bloodied (HP ≤ half max) AND has at least 1 HP. No current surface type models a conditional predicate on HP state that gates an automatic effect. This is a new kind of trigger condition not present in any existing family.","evidence":"Heroic Rally: 'if you are Bloodied and have at least 1 Hit Point'"},{"kind":"new_atom","name":"modify_roll_threshold (death save 18–20 → 20)","justification":"Defy Death's second clause widens the automatic-success threshold on Death Saving Throws from 20 to 18–20. v4 has no atom for 'treat rolls ≥ N as the maximum result' on a specific roll type. This is mechanically distinct from modify_roll_advantage and from the existing crit-window pressure noted in v4 §12.","evidence":"Defy Death: 'when you roll 18–20 on a Death Saving Throw, you gain the benefit of rolling a 20 on it.'"}],"claude_confidence":"high","discrepancies":["no content/fighter_survivor_l18.json authored; accepted self-report-only widening path"],"typecheck_stderr":"","tracer_stderr":"","wall_seconds":0}
